sons.","zh":"人生有四季。"},{"en":"Yesterday, today and tomorrow— these are the three days of man.","zh":"人生有三天：昨天、今天和明天。"},{"en":"Let sleeping dogs lie.","zh":"别惹是生非。"},{"en":"It’s the empty can that makes the most noise.","zh":"半瓶水响叮当。"}]}}}